.DS_Store

# Editor / tooling backups produced in place
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.backup
*.backup.*
*.before-*
*.pre-split-*
*.hub-backup-*
*.orig
*.tmp
*~

# Per-machine run data — every pipeline run appends to it
metrics.csv
review-runs.jsonl
review-ledger.jsonl
/skills/oneshot-pipeline/runs/

# Runtime adapter files holding employer-specific values
**/repository-adapter.local.md
*.local.json
.env
.env.*

# 2026-09-17: the deny-list that used to sit here is gone. The repo is private and
# personal, and every skill, agent and command in it is tracked on purpose. What
# stays out is credentials, customer data, per-machine run data and backups — the
# rules above, which are about content, not about which customisation it belongs to.
